# User intent: the one place the team server's secrets go on the host, so they never sit in the world-readable unit.
# Install as /etc/taskmaster/taskmaster.env, owned root:root, mode 0600 (systemd reads it before dropping to the
# service user). Leave it absent if Linear is not used.

# Linear's API token for the host-side Linear worker (team-server-005: the only name the server accepts).
#TASKMASTER_LINEAR_TOKEN=
